   "id": "Zj6Ucx2d5qAJ",
   "from": "Ben Goodrich",
   "author": "743bbacc59f4b25f",
   "date": "2015-03-03T18:31:21Z",
   "subject": "Re: [stan-dev] Re: Stan v2.6.1 tagged",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I already have a local commit that updated StanHeaders/inst/include/upstream to the new master before I discovered that we need to make changes on the rstan side too. I think there will be no conflict if you also go into StanHeaders/inst/include/upstream and do git pull origin master but there might be a merge conflict if you set the HEAD to v.2.6.1 . I think master would be the better choice.<br><br>Ben</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Tuesday, March 3, 2015 at 1:25:20 PM UTC-5, Ben Goodrich wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Great.<br><br>On Tuesday, March 3, 2015 at 1:22:22 PM UTC-5, Jiqiang Guo wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Ben, I have a branch (debug/test_grad_crash) that has a lot of changes due to this folder/namespace renaming.  I will merge it to develop.  <div><br></div><div>Jiqiang </div></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Mar 3, 2015 at 1:16 PM, Ben Goodrich <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href rel=\"nofollow\" data-email-masked>goodri...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Also, what replaces this now non-existent file<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">common</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">do_print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span><font color=\"#888888\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></font></span></div></code></div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>Ben</font></span><div><div><br><br>On Tuesday, March 3, 2015 at 1:10:42 PM UTC-5, Ben Goodrich wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Bob, how do you build the parser now? Before in rstan, we had a bunch of things like<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">stan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">gm</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">compiler</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hpp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>but now gm/ is gone and appears to be replaced by lang/ Is that all that needs to be switched?<br><br>Ben<br><br>On Tuesday, March 3, 2015 at 12:44:59 PM UTC-5, Daniel Lee wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I forgot to add the release notes to that branch. I&#39;ll update the file in Stan, but it won&#39;t be tagged until the next release.<br><br><br></div>Daniel<br><br></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Mar 3, 2015 at 12:01 PM, Daniel Lee <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href rel=\"nofollow\" data-email-masked>bea...@alum.mit.edu</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/releases/tag/v2.6.1\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/releases/tag/v2.6.1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473723942000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1qIQGUQcRSU3rSwVKoSa2A\">https://github.com/stan-dev/<u></u>stan/releases/tag/v2.6.1</a><br></div>\r\n</blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></blockquote></div></div></div><div><div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;stan development mailing list&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href rel=\"nofollow\" data-email-masked>stan-dev+unsubscribe@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792473723942000&amp;usg=AOvVaw05n-fDqco6FoFF0N1myIYo\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</div></div></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></blockquote></div>"
